.TH YOGABOOK-GNSS-HEALTH 8 "August 2026" "yogabook-gnss 1.0.3"
.SH NAME
yogabook-gnss-health \- verify Yoga Book GNSS transport
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B yogabook-gnss-health
.RB [ --require-sky ]
.RB [ --require-fix ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Checks the YB1-X91L DMI identity, vendor transport service, GPS rfkill state,
NMEA FIFO, gpsd socket, a bounded gpsd TPV stream and raw GGA/RMC/GSV data.
The default result proves transport, not complete sky geometry or an outdoor
satellite fix.  gpsd intentionally suppresses SKY output when indoor GSV data
lacks satellite azimuth or elevation.
.PP
.B --require-sky
also requires complete gpsd SKY data.
.B --require-fix
implies
.B --require-sky
and additionally requires a TPV mode 2 or 3 geographic fix.  Use these strict
checks outdoors with a clear view of the sky.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR gpsd (8),
.BR gpspipe (1),
.BR yogabook-gnss-import (8)
